  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Ta Orion-81 ny hoaylley cummit liorish AI.<\/0> Va dy chooilley linney jeh kod Orion-81 hene screeuit lesh Claude Code, stiurit liorish yn fo-ayrey. Va dy chooilley lhong, mapp, cummey as sheean jeant liorish ooillyn screeuit ec Claude Code. Ta'n fo-ayrey cur raad cre dy yannoo; ta Claude Code gheddyn magh kys. Ta ny lioarlannyn foshlit-bun t'eh troggal orroo currit er rolley heose fo 'Cha vel jeant liorish AI'. Ta un red foast foshlit as soilshit gys foshlit: <1>studeyrys lisheanse<\/1> jeh kod y chluich haink veih'n phrototype GPL.",
