  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Er-y-fa dy vel yn chymmey echey jeant dy phaaghey ad. Ta'n chluich goaill toshiaght jeant dy slane liorish AI dy vod eh ve ayn dy bragh; eisht ta saareyn-grayse paait cur ayns ynnyd obbyr AI, lesh ennym.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Vod mee cluich er-linney?",
