  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Fyssyn",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Cha vel foast. Ta ymmodee-cluicheyr LAN er yn eddyr-rea cheddin gobbraghey jiu (veih 0.2.0); cha vel cluich er-linney savit.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Va'n prototype troggit er yn injin foshlit-bun Quake III Arena (GPL) as ghow lhongyn Elite Dangerous myr chengooyn. Er yn nah laa ghow kod y chluich gys BuB, injin noa screeuit lesh Claude Code; haink ny moduillyn cluiche veih'n phrototype as v'ad ennymmit reesht. Hug lhieggan 0.3.0 corpyn noa da ooilley ny 16 sorçhyn lhongey. Ta studeyrys cooid-lisheanse jeeaghyn quoi-erbee ec y kod ta foast cummit veih'n bun GPL as quoi-erbee ec dooghys ny lhongyn ghoshee ta ro ghenn da'n chengooyn oc. Ren scanney casley lheid dy chod noi bun y phrototype GPL goll er <0/>, as ta studeyrys ny fir-hushtey jeh ny rheynn echey ayns lhiurid. Bee quoi-erbee ta cummit ro-screeuit ny ro-chummit reesht. Derrey ta'n studeyrys jeant, cha vel shin gra dy vel y fregney cha nee.",
  "faq.questions": "Fyssyn",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Lhongyn, ealin, bun-eddyr as ny smoo, myr t'yn chymmey lhig. <0>Yn lioar er y duillag shoh<\/0> rolley dy chooilley elment as nee soilshaghey dy chooilley ynnyd-currit as y saaree-grayse echey.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Ta lhongyn as ardjyn plannit dy ve geddit liorish cluich ny kionnit. Ta kys ta lhongyn paait freill cairal ayns caggey cleaysh-noi-cleaysh foast jeant.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Shen y phlan: cluich er fardail lesh argid ayns y chluich as cummeyn bunneydagh. Cha vel eh savit foast.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Row obbyr quoi-erbee coppit?",
