  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Ta Anthropic, Claude as Claude Code mark-earrooagh Anthropic, PBC. Ta Unreal Engine as Epic Games mark-earrooagh Epic Games, Inc. Ta Blender mark-earrooagh y Blender Foundation. Ta Quake III Arena as Elite Dangerous mark-earrooagh ny berchagyn oc. Ta ooilley ny ennymyn lhiasagh da ny berchagyn oc as ymmydit ny-lomarcan dy hoilshaghey ny pheeshyn t'er ny enmys. Cha vel Orion-81 kianglt rish, taishbynit ny cadjin liorish quoi-erbee jeu.",
