  "footer.notLiveYet": "Cha vel bio foast",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ta un red foast foshlit: yn <0>studeyrys lisheanse<\/0> jeh kod y chluich haink veih'n phrototype GPL. Ren scanney casley lheid dy chod noi bun y phrototype goll er <1/>, as ta studeyrys ny fir-hushtey jeh ny rheynn echey ayns lhiurid.",
